      "_hint": "[FALSE PERSPECTIVE] Exaggerate the size of weapons or limbs closer to the camera to enhance impact (perspective emphasis).",
      "apply_perspective_distortion": "moderate_to_high",
      "focus_point": "weapon_tip_or_muzzle"
